  "passives": [
    {
      "name": "Ever-Keen Frost",
      "description": "Radiance: Stellar-Conduct: When a Frostpierce Star is on the field, DMG from the Traveler's Normal Attacks, Charged Attacks, and Plunging Attacks are converted to Cryo DMG that cannot be overridden by another elemental infusion, and DMG dealt is also increased by 80% of the Traveler's ATK."
    },
    {
      "name": "Lucent Ice",
      "description": "The Traveler's Elemental Mastery is increased by 8% of their ATK. Up to 160 Elemental Mastery can be gained in this way."
    },
    {
      "name": "Stellar Jubilee: Illusory Frostmirror",
      "description": "The Traveler will enter the {LINK#N11330003}Radiance: Stellar-Conduct{/LINK} state when inside a Polestar Field, or the Radiance: Stellar Swirl state for 8s after a nearby party member triggers a Stellar Swirl reaction.\nWhen a party member triggers a Superconduct or Cryo Swirl reaction, it becomes a Stellar-Conduct or Stellar Swirl reaction instead, and the Base DMG of said reaction is also increased by 0.35% for every 100 points of the Traveler's ATK. A maximum 7% increase can be obtained in this way."
    },
    {
      "name": "Foreign Permafrost",
      "description": "Draws new strength and power from their past travels: Every Elemental Type the Traveler has resonated with now grants an additional {LINK#N10050001}enhancement effect{/LINK}.\n\nAdditionally, when a nearby party member deals Stellar-Conduct or Stellar Swirl DMG, the Traveler gains 1 stack of \"Icepoint.\" 1 stack of Icepoint can be obtained in this way once every 2s, max 3 stacks. When the Traveler unleashes a Charged Attack at 3 stacks of Icepoint, all stacks are consumed to change the attack into a special Charged Attack: Freezing Ice.\n\nCharged Attack: Freezing Ice\n· Cryo DMG dealt is increased by 140% of the Traveler's ATK, and the Traveler also gains 2 stacks of {LINK#N10050002}Frostglow{/LINK}.\n· Charged Attack: Freezing Ice can be unleashed once every 15s. Additionally, the DMG Bonus from the Ascension Talent \"Ever-Keen Frost\" does not apply to Charged Attack: Freezing Ice.\n{LINK#N11500004}Radiance: Stellar Glimmer{/LINK}: DMG from Charged Attack: Freezing Ice is instead considered Cryo DMG of the corresponding Stellar Glimmer reaction type."
    }
  ],
  "constellations": [
    {
      "level": 1,
      "name": "1. Somber Freeze",
      "description": "The Traveler regenerates 5 Elemental Energy when they deal Stellar Glimmer DMG. This effect can trigger once every 0.5s."
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "name": "2. Frostfall Reverberation",
      "description": "The active character's Elemental Mastery is increased by 60 for 5s when an opponent is hit by an ice crystal fired by the Elemental Skill {LINK#S10127}Ice Fog Piercer{/LINK}.\nAdditionally, when a character affected by the aforementioned effect triggers a Stellar Glimmer reaction or deals Stellar Glimmer reaction DMG, the Elemental Mastery boost described above will be increased to 120 for its duration."
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "name": "3. Glacial Shard",
